{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say those who wander into the back alleys of Hong Kong never return...<br>Driven by curiosity, you ventured in\u2014and truly got lost.<br>Hide from the roaming enemies and find your way out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps and items are randomly generated.<br>Collect the Bagua Mirrors to cleanse evil spirits and head for the exit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of items such as kaleidoscopes and music boxes are available.<br>Use them wisely and don\u2019t get caught!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alley inspired by the Kowloon Walled City.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Content Creation Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome gameplay videos and streams from individuals and organizations alike. However, please read and follow the guidelines below:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include a link to the store page in a location easily accessible to viewers, such as the video description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization through platform features (such as ad revenue, Super Chats, etc.) is permitted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not create or distribute content that includes slander, defamation, or violates public order and morals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QuadrupleGamesis not responsible for any issues or damages that may arise from streaming or distributing gameplay content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These guidelines may be updated without notice. Any videos created after updates will be subject to the revised guidelines.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Play Time\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40\u201360 minutes</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/sto